  "agent": {
    "note": "## stress-11 — brand-m-auto\n\nThe brand M as rects (@m0saic/brand/logo/v3 size m-33): 33 painted tiles, 48 nulls, 2,457 passthroughs — 5,150 steps.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| chars / steps | 5150 / 5150 |\n| tier | **summarize** (teach ≤ 400 chars · summarize ≤ 8,000 · sloth beyond) |\n| length | 30.0 s (Speed pill ~155×; 77.3 min at 1×) |\n\nRender: `m0saic make packages/sandbox/production/dsl-tutorial-v1/stress/stress-11.mosaicx -w 960 -h 540 -o /tmp/dsl-tutorial-heavy-review/stress-11.mp4`",
    "question": "SUMMARIZE tier (5,150 chars > 400): the whole walk in 30 s (Speed pill ~150×), camera on the full layout, split scaffolding at 35% and each dash clears the moment the tile that absorbed it paints. Is 30 s the right \"watch the renderer paint\" length? Do the light dividers still read as noise? (The carry now reads ≤ 1,920px.)"
  },
